      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.75 (vs ₹0.95 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.75 (down from ₹0.95 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹716.9m (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹11.1m (down 21% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.5% (down from 2.2% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 1% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
